ey":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg(f)\">\\(\\deg(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdddab942ae105d7\" href=\"?note=fdddab942ae105d7\" title=\"28-df-multilinear-degree\">28-df-multilinear-degree</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\">\\(D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4526464ba7e934ba\" href=\"?note=4526464ba7e934ba\" title=\"28-df-decision-tree\">28-df-decision-tree</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\deg(f)\\le D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\deg(f)\\le D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将最优树重复查询删去。深度d树的根查询X_i，子树函数多项式分别p_0,p_1；组合(1−X_i)p_0+X_ip_1在布尔立方上计算f，次数至多d。将X_i高次幂替换为X_i不会提高次数，再由唯一性等于p_f。叶对应常数，为归纳基。</p>\n<p>来源：§12.4.3 and Exercise 12.7；印刷页 267,269；PDF 页 293,295。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第12章的 Polynomial Degree Lower Bounds Decision Tree Depth，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-multilinear-degree","status":"resolved","id":"fdddab942ae105d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-multilinear-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-decision-tree","status":"resolved","id":"4526464ba7e934ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-decision-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-multilinear-degree","status":"resolved","id":"fdddab942ae105d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\deg(f)$ 见 [[28-df-multilinear-degree]]，$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-decision-tree","status":"resolved","id":"4526464ba7e934ba","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\deg(f)$ 见 [[28-df-multilinear-degree]]，$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg(f)","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg(f)\\le D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1614,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-338","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-zero-error-query-complexity]]、[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]、[[28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds]]、[[28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound]]、[[28-df-multilinear-degree]]、[[28-lem-degree-query-lower-bound]]、[[28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds]]。"}],"outgoing":["fdddab942ae105d7","4526464ba7e934ba"]}